00:08:04.419 --> 00:08:10.669
his existential status is indeterminate because
since God is everything then it’s very difficult

00:08:10.669 --> 00:08:14.819
to make the case that the evil spirit isn't
a derivative of God it’s not easy thing

00:08:14.819 --> 00:08:19.949
to get straightened out rationally
and I think Milton in Paradise Lost has a

00:08:19.949 --> 00:08:25.569
very good attempt good attempt to explain
